## Bigint & ISO Datetime

What to test:

- Bigint values (within and beyond `Number.MAX_SAFE_INTEGER`) and ISO-8601 datetime strings render correctly across every series type.
- Switching the data mode picks the appropriate axis type (number for bigint; `time` / `unit-time` for ISO datetime).
- Stacking, grouping and 100%-stacked layouts apply only where the series supports them.

{% chartExampleRunner title="Bigint & ISO Datetime" name="bigint-iso-datetime" type="generated" /%}

## Grouped Category — Single Level

What to test:

- A single-level grouped-category axis renders identically to a standard category axis.
- The configured blue tick stroke applies to the x axis.

{% chartExampleRunner title="Grouped Category" name="grouped-category" type="generated" /%}

## Grouped Category — Depth Options

What to test:

- Per-depth label styling (bold parent labels, smaller leaf font) renders correctly across all levels.
- Tick visibility is suppressed at the depth configured with `tick.enabled: false`.
- Adjusting the rotation slider re-flows labels without truncation artefacts.

{% chartExampleRunner title="Grouped Category" name="grouped-category-2" type="generated" /%}

## Grouped Category — Label Formatters

What to test:

- Axis and series label formatters output values in the `M` (millions) shorthand.
- Group headings remain visible alongside the formatted leaf labels.

{% chartExampleRunner title="Grouped Category" name="grouped-category-3" type="generated" /%}

## Grouped Category — Error Bars

What to test:

- Error bars render on each grouped bar at the configured low/high values.
- Groups align cleanly across both drought and control series.

{% chartExampleRunner title="Grouped Category" name="grouped-category-4" type="generated" /%}

## Grouped Category — Normalised Stacked

What to test:

- Stacked bars total to 100% within each group on the grouped-category axis.
- Group separators align with the underlying category boundaries.

{% chartExampleRunner title="Grouped Category" name="grouped-category-5" type="generated" /%}

## Grouped Category — Multi-Series Error Bars

What to test:

- Each of the three series renders its own error bars on the grouped axis without overlap.
- Tooltips report the correct high/low values per category.

{% chartExampleRunner title="Grouped Category" name="grouped-category-6" type="generated" /%}

## Grouped Category — Stacked With Labels

What to test:

- In-bar labels render on each stacked segment and do not collide with group boundaries.
- Legend is hidden as configured.

{% chartExampleRunner title="Grouped Category" name="grouped-category-7" type="generated" /%}

## Grouped Category — Multi-Stack With Rotation

What to test:

- All five stacked series display labels at the correct positions on the grouped axis.
- The rotation slider rotates leaf labels live without breaking group header layout.

{% chartExampleRunner title="Grouped Category" name="grouped-category-8" type="generated" /%}
